er":1,"episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"342345","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[1]}],"link":"90132","synopsis":"チバ県からグンマ県に引っ越すこととなった神月。引っ越し先の移動中、グンマ県在住の親友、轟へ連絡するが、「…来るな、グンマに来て生きて帰った者はいない」と告げられてしまう。不思議に思う神月に早速、グンマの洗礼が襲う。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8L2xEcwyAIX8ffZQNM7fnxyH6wr.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 2","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13781","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101042","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"37258","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78474","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"342345","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"90133","synopsis":"転校初日、自己紹介でチバ県から来たことを告げる神月。\n\nその瞬間、教室の生徒からザワザワと小声が。\n\n気のせいだと自分に言い聞かせる神月の前に、授業の始まりの号令。\n\nそこでまた神月はグンマの真実を知る！","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/o4v2EwiAt0WM7ybgmgruPAvpWx9.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13781","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101042","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"37258","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78474","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"342345","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"90134","synopsis":"グンマ人ではないということで拘束される神月。そんな神月に対してざわめく生徒たち。\n\nそこへ「静粛に！」と一括する一人の女子生徒。その手にはグンマ人必須アイテムの「上毛かるた」が！","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ofdE6UgSZ243yhnQQ0OxmYT08QT.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13781","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101042","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"37258","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78474","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"342345","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"90135","synopsis":"グンマ県のソウルフード「焼きまんじゅう」を食べることとなった神月。\n\nグンマ人以外が食べると死に至る可能性があると轟より伝えられる。\n\n怯える神月の前に「焼きまんじゅう」が差し出され…","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hjDxoLAALj9oA98YW2svBJNQ5wR.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13781","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101042","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"37258","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78474","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"342345","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"90136","synopsis":"熱いグンマの洗礼を受け、グンマに馴染んできたと感じる神月。\n\nそんな神月に声をかける一人の女子生徒。\n\n優しく接する女子生徒に浮かれる神月であったが、そこには…","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/v8mhlV85kMnwbaknkFZi344hTmA.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13781","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101042","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"37258","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78474","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"342345","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"90137","synopsis":"篠岡京がリーダーを務めるJKJ(上毛かるたユーゲント)より「グンマ人として認めない」と告げられる神月。\n\n驚く神月に轟が「説明しよう」と言う。\n\nJKJとはいったい？そして、上毛かるたとは？","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7l03JImLv6ZxPE4qqwDFl6CYok.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13781","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101042","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"37258","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78474","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"342345","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"90138","synopsis":"グンマの生活に慣れてきた神月ではあったが、自転車通学時のグンマに吹き付ける強風「からっ風」に翻弄されていた。行きは向かい風、帰りは追い風。\n\nそんなからっ風の服下校時、神月は、少年と出会い…","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4rPGXUF09n50iec886I3SOINShw.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13781","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101042","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"37258","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78474","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"342345","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"90139","synopsis":"従兄弟の実くんの運動会へ参加することとなった神月。\n\n運動会当日、久しぶりに会う実くんを思い、実くんと一緒に行った海水浴を思い出す神月であった。\n\nその思い出の中の実くんは…","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7Fm8OlUTYgFydx7gF5O8hozmX5s.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13781","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101042","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"37258","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78474","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"342345","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"90140","synopsis":"久しぶりの再会に喜ぶ神月と実くん。\n\n神月は、運動会の活躍をビデオカメラでしっかり撮影すると実くんへ宣言する。\n\n神月が実くんに所属のチームを確認すると、表情が曇る実くん。\n\nそこにはまた一つグンマの真実が！","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5JmmFSvr2sP27wBs2ucFZa7YqGF.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13781","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101042","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"37258","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78474","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"342345","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"90141","synopsis":"ひょんなことから借り物競走で勝負することとなった神月と篠岡。\n\n借り物競走のお題は「グンマの名物」。\n\n不利な条件の中、全力で臨む神月に、衝撃の結末が・・・！","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gX8VNTrQA1ZQMuhmVBstYJjoVEn.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13781","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101042","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"37258","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78474","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"342345","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"90142","synopsis":"放課後、自転車を止め、看板を見つめる神月。そこには「自販機店」の文字。\n\n店内には、うどんの自販機。他にも数多くの自動販売機が。\n\nここは一体、何なのか!?\n\n自販機店舗の知られざる真実が明らかになる！","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jw7qJZPPFJUeSlJDhJ9h1BkuR7V.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 12","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13781","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101042","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"37258","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78474","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"342345","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"90143","synopsis":"野汁先輩の運転する車で妙義神社へ向かう神月、轟、篠岡、イエティー。\n\n日本三大奇景である妙義山にある妙義神社にテンションが上がる篠岡。\n\nそんな篠岡の私服姿にニヤつく神月。\n\nそんな時、カーブで突然、トラックが現れ…","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zldaVnfwwdPNw5qUVKbig1YD8d.jpg"}],"sourceIds":{"anilistId":101042,"malId":37258},"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-28T07:48:11Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:101042","mal:37258"],"targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13781","scope":"R","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101042","ranges":{"1-